  "description": "meme-id: happy-birthday-i-nose-it-will-be-good; hasOverallIntent: harmful; overall-intent-description: The image features a close-up of the character Voldemort from the Harry Potter series, with a distorted, menacing facial expression and the text \"happy birthday i nose it will be good\" overlaid. The text is a pun on Voldemort's famous line \"I know it will be good\" from the movie, but altered to include the word \"nose\" as a play on his distinctive nose. The overall intent is to create a darkly humorous, sarcastic, or ironic birthday greeting by leveraging the character's villainous persona. While not overtly abusive or hateful toward any specific group, the meme's intent is harmful because it uses a character associated with extreme evil and violence to deliver a birthday message, which can be unsettling or inappropriate for some audiences. The humor relies on the juxtaposition of a celebratory occasion with a menacing figure, potentially causing discomfort or distress. The meme does not contain explicit toxicity toward protected characteristics, but its use of a violent, anti-heroic character for a benign purpose can be seen as a form of dark humor that may be considered harmful due to its potential to unsettle or provoke negative emotional responses in viewers.",
